{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "3efd816c517f93779a1e62a49e1a0e21d0c5567d75e85a51b0bec8af988d6e1a", "ja": "まずはリサーチ", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cbbcbdcf67a94b380a78cec09c2ef2a2e343665e97139beea100f881ec8c02e4", "ja": "杏奈をメンバーに加えた一同は、新企画番組\n『#プレイリスト』の初回撮影に向け、対戦\n相手となる3人組の配信番組を見てみること\nに。果たして相手はトークも上手く、歌もダ\nンスも高水準……さて、どう挑む？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c17ec3638b6e0813183b196b7ff8704ba4096fab1bb955f0d78c58f61956023d", "ja": "（ネトスワとのミーティング内容を、社長に報告。\n話し合いの結果、オファーを受ける事にした）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7bf9153657602bfff9652df29bd9ac6ea619b2b69fe808adf4c02a2b2684a3e2", "ja": "（『#プレイリスト』、ネトスワで独占配信だ）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "24c20f5ab4b0518af6678a71a89b92336edaea3e50fa5bad5971a20d66f2b09a", "ja": "……杏奈がいない間に……\n大変なこと、あったんだね……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "95dbce958808a9e30f53cff3c96b41361ee94e21ed5f08ecf882f0c74df85223", "ja": "ああ……。\n私はなんてことを……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0fb3237d8fb063b38b341be852246764bfe92b6849404624a17ebead7b5a5b8a", "ja": "あの時、私が啖呵を切らなければ\n揚げ足を取られることもなかったものを……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "a75c02300a10cc24c44ef99eb3ea30b0ad82f7636af99d8f7d404b9e80f921b9", "ja": "気にすることないよ、紬ちゃん！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "e333ec76264cea8c8a143f321c784cc49cacc48e678342937bd281a362a7d34a", "ja": "だって、すっごくゴーインだったし！\nあと、嫌なことたくさん言われたし！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "305b248de02c0ed2f7aab0de3e671596835f75682b0ab2d5fa1006a535f53e70", "ja": "うん！　私たちの765プロが大したことあるって、\nちゃんと知ってもらうためにも……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "cd27f4984a47ae933fb151ffc1cee26de9151219ce744189dd1160fd09167db0", "ja": "私たちのパワー、全開で見せちゃいましょう！\nおいでよ～♪　ここは素敵な765プロ～♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0e0f917206b16fa9e6df2214242537ae970d2a2f92708db0b23f76fcc913b739", "ja": "ですが……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2dadff5269086ea76d92916ba2935460d374de188f789cbf3c58b6034ff1126c", "ja": "紬、そんなに気にしなくていいよ。契約書には\nちゃんと目を通したけど、おかしな点はなかったんだ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2d3d3c859bbfbeeb6a690bdda6c73a28a72ce7798197c76b00128541f90bfea6", "ja": "ただ、警戒は必要だけどな。\nなにか狙いがある気がするんだ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "8809dc307926c8c57a8ae36e74fea0d3b3420bea0b3f5fe6e6be6c809e3936d4", "ja": "狙い……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1013_p", "source_sha256": "756addd2576469f517d517ec3911424fc10373e7f9b93293e72bb396299d4422", "ja": "うん。けど、そこを考えるのは俺の仕事だから。\nみんなはアイドルとして、仕事に集中してほしい！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6351a2699c15da56cc2fb9776714efc470370e7d5a90a07862bc6e5ffa62a5f3", "ja": "ネトスワでの配信番組が、大きなチャンスである事に\n違いはない。ぜひものにしよう！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "6b4bcd2de9dd4213ae06dc265ba474df3981da97764f9d26808ac79dafd15145", "ja": "はい！　全力でがんばります！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "605e675f22b817c239f55c78fb70bcda8c34c5f569ad71549cfbea797ca09061", "ja": "私も、いつもの倍以上に歌のレッスン、\nがんばりまーす！　らんらら～♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "75df974100b3c62f9eec1ab917bd02a6522606f1c5bb3951da8b685a1719cfc0", "ja": "そう、ですね……。\nそれが罪を償う、唯一の方法……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "fc0e1ba2da4bf30051e5101074b66f98016588f56bd4fc58670d921769fa89cf", "ja": "いや、罪とか、そこまでじゃないから……。\n契約は俺がしたんだし……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "fd5cd1c14b4a0004824772f4d6c5d1655d494608533b589491b9af8ba6ff0319", "ja": "ん……杏奈も、新曲と歌詞……\nちゃんと頭に入れておく、ね……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "116a10b50a82ad1e6918970ecd3d1b51b46e8765ce37205194432e85bcc81229", "ja": "ああ。まずは、初回の撮影に向けて準備だな。\nそうだ、みんな揃ってるし……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1021_p", "source_sha256": "4c12bd78552a24f7f275660c10ea59cf85d2852c6192efc78e9f7a5f4050eb65", "ja": "対戦相手だっていう3人の、配信番組を見てみようか。\n何かの参考になるはずだ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1022_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1023_kirano", "source_sha256": "8f145c150853c635e60885e4b1dde16e57c9e6ec8e47ac398334f2317210df34", "ja": "『やっほー、希良乃だよ！　今日はフリー\nトーク回だから、好きなことしゃべろっか』", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1024_moa", "source_sha256": "a30384cc15d4b36afa509d081c828dac5600e998623e0750f59dcd823ae9c8fb", "ja": "『もー、丸投げすぎー』", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1025_051tmg", "source_sha256": "82971cf1ebfb96dcf5e8d88c89af9b2f729c025265f7dcc0872af0d12ef2431a", "ja": "フリートーク回……\n配信番組には、そういうのもあるのですね。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1026_kanon", "source_sha256": "18b2dbc3c70ec05a00d37d131d570fa6396b0a4137c6f78cab9bc9e98485e260", "ja": "『それなら私のオカルト語りで。頭痛アプリを\n見ても低気圧じゃない時は、実はお部屋に……』", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1028_kirano", "source_sha256": "68cdcef47f980f5dffdc05f46dd57a9c7b5a86acf235e57587211da08f5db588", "ja": "『あー香喃のオカルトは怖すぎるからダメ。\nほら、コメントで視聴者怖がってるじゃん』", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "6291f226c7c0faa623c43c6b1f7ccf34fc8365eae9990d702c94028da699268a", "ja": "あれ、続きは……？　静香ちゃんも、\nたまに同じ事言ってたから気になるのに～。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a83f6e7b572df21fe18658b62e5aaf04ae49c421da5ad55ec6bad600cad43985", "ja": "実は私も、頭痛アプリを見ても\n低気圧ではないことが、時々あるのですが……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1031_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7a549d56f98d18693b68e2f6fa7b8debad04632a675cdb4e240f2fb73891cae6", "ja": "そういう時はお部屋に、なんなのですか！？\n途中でやめられると気になって……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "09b6efa6a20b43f699d044c5c11432b4ebce024fb7618152e0bb6a80e8674feb", "ja": "ねー！\n私も続きが気になるな～。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1033_p", "source_sha256": "dec17c16a6508a0edf88dfd2cd0eae7b8520d012aaa384359c21255df8cd564a", "ja": "（続きが気になる……紬と未来で温度差は\nあるものの、確かに興味を引いてはいるな）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1034_moa", "source_sha256": "cc18d717372aa1070d90ea7d1b5c7ddf7ca20b1e5673107427fe4f23063a1fc8", "ja": "『萌亞はー、最近は新作ゲームしてた！\n今度自分の枠でゲーム配信しよっかな』", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1035_kirano", "source_sha256": "e7924bac82b0a1f2208a3ebdf5c3b0d81c30e891dd3e94a7b04199a221a032d3", "ja": "『ゲームってことは、また萌亞はあれでしょ。\n風呂キャンしてるんでしょ』", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1036_036kan", "source_sha256": "82b4deeb8cd978c40d573039a70ab82e3523eb6d13cb3baff99d90043ab0977d", "ja": "ふろキャン……？\nお風呂でキャンプ……とか、そういうことかな？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1037_024ann", "source_sha256": "5a48263e46f7a44caacf33bfb4aa0a69046a72ad4ced54b31afaa87464940587", "ja": "風呂キャンは、お風呂キャンセル……の、意味……。\nお風呂、入らない……だけ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1038_036kan", "source_sha256": "a23ff2739a6b80d84028952f3928245e50076f2c06b5978eae24ae9c34641e11", "ja": "えーっ！？　お風呂入らないの！？\nき、汚くなっちゃうのに、どうして？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1039_024ann", "source_sha256": "69e937838b0b86bb6f919c4a603c655d80273dcb702a77b9e04a835a2902e9b8", "ja": "んと……ゲームに、集中してると……\nお風呂とか、食事……面倒……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1040_p", "source_sha256": "ee268241a7c98744b164630f339befd3471405221964b178d8f755cb46e23612", "ja": "な、なるほど……限界界隈というやつか。\n闇を感じるな……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1041_moa", "source_sha256": "024aa3cf96bab6259e1ff076d60f7783bd99f191e8bcdcdf5b4667baa59cf7cc", "ja": "『ほら、コメントで誤解してる人いるじゃん！\n萌亞はお風呂入らなくてもきれいなの！』", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1042_moa", "source_sha256": "942d120054f051043354bf8f8de6d8e14570c6486200eba55f3754bddbccf015", "ja": "『それにドライシャンプーしてるから！\nいつだってフローラルだからね～♪』", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1043_036kan", "source_sha256": "748ba6c2726ed6ef722458d8b2918e27d6adce42c63728db6bf6659006f2e36e", "ja": "ゲームに集中して、お風呂を……。\n……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1044_024ann", "source_sha256": "19e3feb1af286b9f3e5d34dbc0b9e2d122a39e03928ab8dc913f0ed89f2d31dc", "ja": "可奈……今、杏奈のにおい、\nかいだ……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1045_036kan", "source_sha256": "8b64f5e89d4adeb31b66eea97bbfb56de8fcab047b01c2f05e8c25b701132abc", "ja": "はっ！？\nい、いつもの杏奈ちゃんの匂いだったよ！？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1046_024ann", "source_sha256": "b78c072cbb4d2a06166378dde852640c452cf38c19f567b8dbb4d743ad52db03", "ja": "杏奈は……風呂キャン、しない……。\nアイドルだし……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1047_024ann", "source_sha256": "677628346086bca0f806a4d1616f548f1d1cd84532d0bf21a4762d6cc50524fc", "ja": "外に出る時は……尚更……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1048_p", "source_sha256": "9c3d330a0bcb503dc36be193cf1da3498586631e7ad99fcaa2de379f92f3b620", "ja": "（ホッ）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1049_036kan", "source_sha256": "b4abfb9535a2107319f357540a87fcb29e460e223d380339d002e57e59a3605b", "ja": "ご、ごめ～ん！　杏奈ちゃーん！\nほんのちょっと、気になっちゃって～！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1050_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1051_036kan", "source_sha256": "2b6c2e353c0e925fb8e77a55ca252a9680a517622f181f7a89c77a0634bc66fc", "ja": "あの3人の配信、結構面白かったな～……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1052_051tmg", "source_sha256": "055ec796977cbba5754b0946e9c4a4eabaf178373d032d7106c821774b42347b", "ja": "はい。おしゃべりが面白く、\nつい夢中で見てしまいました……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1053_014mir", "source_sha256": "9570d44ccbf4df8cd79fb042b523f599ef801a5f705e44d1c796310ddf9fd85a", "ja": "あと、番組最後に流れてた曲もよかった！\nダンスがかっこよくて。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1054_024ann", "source_sha256": "500f8bff772a3ffed5d7967255b1673d009d16c6046e9d5ddb209a0ef7bd19da", "ja": "ん。杏奈も、そう思う……。\n曲……すごくよかった……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1055_p", "source_sha256": "abe62c9816fe52ea51437289feee7b48ca98b894557f07d7abb64002af5fa20d", "ja": "（それぞれ相手を分析しようとしているな。\n意欲が衰えてないのは、さすがだ！）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_03_1056_p", "source_sha256": "b995cd06375f234408c1c888865e96a960594abac5d36e9d4cabd83b1e9f8374", "ja": "（どう配信というものに取り組んでいくか、\nみんなのやり方をまずは見守ろう！）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
